AND SO BY HAVING THE GOVERNMENT

00:02:13.145 --> 00:02:14.529
FORCE IT ON YOU -- YOU’RE NOT

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:16.250
BUILDING THE TRUST WHERE WE HAVE

00:02:16.283 --> 00:02:17.411
THE HEART TRUST WITH THOSE OTHER

00:02:17.412 --> 00:02:17.668
VACCINES.

