ALONG, AND THAT’S WHY IT SHOULD

00:02:22.728 --> 00:02:24.216
BE A PERSONAL CHOICE AND NOT

00:02:24.217 --> 00:02:24.981
SOMETHING MANDATED BY THE

00:02:24.992 --> 00:02:26.051
GOVERNMENT BURIED &gt;&gt; Chris:

00:02:26.085 --> 00:02:27.407
BUT FORGIVE ME, SIR.

