POLIO THAT HAS VERY DEVASTATING

00:03:11.025 --> 00:03:12.806
EFFECTS AND CERTAINLY WE KNOW IF

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:14.773
YOU’RE OLDER, 65 YEARS AND

00:03:14.784 --> 00:03:16.371
OLDER, THAT’S WERE 83% OF OUR

00:03:16.372 --> 00:03:17.463
DEATHS IN NEBRASKA CAME FROM, WE

00:03:17.474 --> 00:03:19.451
KNOW THIS IS REALLY DEVASTATING,

