IT’S ALL ABOUT BALANCING OFF

00:03:39.924 --> 00:03:41.914
THESE RISKS AND THE RISK FOR

00:03:41.925 --> 00:03:43.832
THIS IS JUST SUCH WHERE THIS IS

00:03:43.843 --> 00:03:44.931
SOMETHING THAT WE SHOULDN’T BE

00:03:44.942 --> 00:03:45.799
MANDATING IT.

