HOW WE’RE DOING IT, IS AROUND

00:03:51.204 --> 00:03:52.573
MAKING SURE WE ARE PRESERVING

00:03:52.584 --> 00:03:54.397
HOSPITAL CAPACITY AND WE’VE

00:03:54.431 --> 00:03:56.515
SUCCESSFULLY DONE THAT HERE.

