&gt;&gt; Governor Ricketts: YEAH,

00:06:09.345 --> 00:06:11.848
AND AGAIN, WHAT WE WOKE US ON

00:06:11.859 --> 00:06:12.936
HIS PRESERVING HOSPITAL CAPACITY

00:06:12.969 --> 00:06:14.149
AND WE HAVE SEEN A STEADY

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:14.664
