00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:58.419
CAPACITY, AND THAT’S OUR GUIDING

00:06:58.452 --> 00:06:59.224
STAR HERE IN NEBRASKA.

00:06:59.235 --> 00:07:00.956
AND WE’VE DONE A VERY

00:07:00.967 --> 00:07:03.333
SUCCESSFULLY, AS I INDICATED

00:07:03.344 --> 00:07:04.912
