IS THERE ISN’T ENOUGH ROOM IN

00:07:37.758 --> 00:07:41.246
YOUR HOSPITALS BY THE END OF

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.808
EACH DAY FOR HIGH-LEVEL CARE.

00:07:42.819 --> 00:07:43.885
&gt;&gt; Governor Ricketts: ACTUALLY

00:07:43.896 --> 00:07:45.501
WHAT WE’VE DONE IS MOVE THE

00:07:45.535 --> 00:07:46.844
PEOPLE AROUND IF WE NEEDED TO,

00:07:46.855 --> 00:07:48.199
THAT’S WHAT THE TRANSFER CENTER

00:07:48.233 --> 00:07:49.768
IS FOR, TO MAKE IT EASIER FOR

00:07:49.779 --> 00:07:51.122
HOSPITALS WHO WANT TO MOVE A

00:07:51.133 --> 00:07:52.518
PATIENT TO GET MORE ACUTE CARE,

00:07:52.552 --> 00:07:54.187
TO BE ABLE TO OFFICIALLY MOVE

00:07:54.198 --> 00:07:56.167
THAT PERSON INTO HOSPITAL.

00:07:56.178 --> 00:07:58.003
THIS PRIMARILY HAPPENS WHEN YOU

00:07:58.037 --> 00:07:59.358
GOT SAY MORE RURAL HOSPITAL

00:07:59.359 --> 00:08:00.906
SETTINGS, MAY NOT HAVE ALL THE

00:08:00.908 --> 00:08:02.226
FACILITIES THAT MAYBE SOME OF

00:08:02.227 --> 00:08:03.213
OUR URBAN CENTERS DO.

00:08:03.215 --> 00:08:05.587
AND ALLOW THEM TO OFFICIALLY GET

00:08:05.598 --> 00:08:07.371
THAT TO THE RIGHT HOSPITAL.

00:08:07.373 --> 00:08:08.376
AND CERTAINLY WE ARE ENCOURAGING

00:08:08.387 --> 00:08:10.204
PEOPLE TO CONTINUE TO GET

00:08:10.205 --> 00:08:12.354
VACCINATED AS PART OF THIS, BUT

00:08:12.365 --> 00:08:13.521
WE ARE MANAGING OUR HOSPITAL

00:08:13.532 --> 00:08:14.932
CAPACITY VERY SUCCESSFULLY HERE

00:08:14.943 --> 00:08:16.951
IN THIS STATE WITH THE TOOLS

00:08:16.962 --> 00:08:18.097
THAT WE HAVE PROVIDED THE

00:08:18.108 --> 00:08:18.565
STAFFING EMERGENCY.

00:08:18.599 --> 00:08:19.670
&gt;&gt; Chris: I ASKED YOUR

00:08:19.681 --> 00:08:21.706
QUESTION AT THE TOP, I ASK YOU

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.102
WHY IT WAS SO OBJECTIONABLE, YOU

00:08:23.113 --> 00:08:23.851
ANSWER THAT.

00:08:23.885 --> 00:08:25.058
YOU DIDN’T ANSWER THE OTHER

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:25.271
QUESTION.

00:08:25.272 --> 00:08:27.342
LET’S FINISH WITH THAT, WERE YOU

00:08:27.353 --> 00:08:29.337
GOING TO DO ABOUT

00:08:29.371 --> 00:08:31.485
PRESIDENT BIDEN’S VACCINE

00:08:31.496 --> 00:08:31.777
MANDATES?

00:08:31.788 --> 00:08:32.660
&gt;&gt; Governor Ricketts: YEAH, SO

00:08:32.694 --> 00:08:34.962
I HAVE BEEN TALKING TO MY

00:08:34.973 --> 00:08:35.651
ATTORNEY GENERAL.

00:08:35.662 --> 00:08:38.015
HE’S COORDINATING WITH THE OTHER

00:08:38.049 --> 00:08:39.829
ATTORNEYS GENERAL ACROSS THE

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.603
COUNTRY WHO SHARE SIMILAR VIEWS

00:08:41.636 --> 00:08:43.330
ABOUT THE OVERREACH, THIS IS A

00:08:43.331 --> 00:08:44.148
EGREGIOUS OVERREACH OF FEDERAL

00:08:44.159 --> 00:08:44.559
AUTHORITY.

00:08:44.594 --> 00:08:46.431
AND AS WE SEE WITH THESE RULES

00:08:46.442 --> 00:08:47.814
ARE, WE WILL BE ABLE TO KNOW

00:08:47.847 --> 00:08:48.838
EXACTLY HOW WE WILL BE ABLE TO

00:08:48.849 --> 00:08:51.129
CHALLENGE THEM IN COURT.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.561
I’M ALSO TALKING WITH MY

00:08:52.594 --> 00:08:54.357
COLLEAGUES AROUND THE COUNTRY AS

00:08:54.359 --> 00:08:56.024
WELL, THE OTHER GOVERNORS WHO

00:08:56.035 --> 00:08:57.784
FEEL THE WAY I DO, AND WE WILL

00:08:57.795 --> 00:08:59.193
BE WORKING ON OTHER STRATEGIES,

00:08:59.226 --> 00:09:01.058
BUT I’VE GOT TO TELL YOU, I HAVE

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.085
HEARD FROM SO MANY WORKERS, SO

00:09:02.087 --> 00:09:03.004
MANY SMALL BUSINESSES WHO SAY

00:09:03.006 --> 00:09:05.078
THIS IS JUST NOT GOING TO BE

00:09:05.089 --> 00:09:06.318
SOMETHING THAT CAN HANDLE.

00:09:06.351 --> 00:09:07.508
SUMMATIVE PEOPLE TOLD ME THEY’RE

00:09:07.509 --> 00:09:09.211
JUST GOING TO BE FIRED IF THEY

00:09:09.222 --> 00:09:10.888
ARE FORCED TO TAKE THE VACCINE.

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.551
THIS IS REALLY GOING TO CREATE

00:09:12.562 --> 00:09:13.893
HUGE PROBLEMS FOR ALL SMALL

00:09:13.894 --> 00:09:15.138
BUSINESSES AND FOR OUR AMERICAN

00:09:15.139 --> 00:09:15.913
WORKERS AND AGAIN, YOU SHOULDN’T

00:09:15.924 --> 00:09:17.064
HAVE TO MAKE THE CHOICE OF

00:09:17.098 --> 00:09:19.339
KEEPING HER JOB OR GETTING A JOB

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.148
IN THE ARM.

00:09:20.159 --> 00:09:21.510
&gt;&gt; Chris: VERY BRIEFLY, YOU

00:09:21.521 --> 00:09:24.189
SAY YOU’RE GOING TO COURT.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.358
ANY IDEA HOW SOON?

00:09:25.392 --> 00:09:26.313
&gt;&gt; Governor Ricketts: WELL,

00:09:26.324 --> 00:09:27.652
WHEN WE GET AN IDEA OF WHAT

00:09:27.663 --> 00:09:28.955
THESE ROLES EXECUTIVE WILL BE,

00:09:28.966 --> 00:09:30.868
WE WILL KNOW HOW TO BE ABLE TO

00:09:30.901 --> 00:09:32.129
ATTACK IT IN COURT.

00:09:32.131 --> 00:09:33.504
&gt;&gt; Chris: GOVERNOR RICKETTS,

00:09:33.515 --> 00:09:33.678
THANK YOU, THANK SPARE TIME

